    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: I didn't know what I was doing, other than closing the gaping wound before
    me. I'd never had the steadiest hand, and my fingers were even less deft now,
    after my weeks of battling starstroke nettles. But I doubted Takkan would care
    about the beauty of my stitches. Page 214
